# One line away from aa-counter: a raider standing inside the engine's own
# outpost radius (360, [[engine-ai-zones]]) of one of our structures pulls the
# reserve onto it, instead of the reserve gathering while the extractor next
# to it dies. The A/B arm for the interception question
# ([[policy-holding-ground]]).

name aa-counter-guard
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
cover 1
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 0
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 0
tech 0
